name calcfrac
category Package
revision 68684
shortdesc Calculates the value of an expression containing fractions
longdesc This package is an engine for calculating numerical expressions
longdesc containing fractions. The numerical value of the expression is
longdesc calculated with a non-expandable method and displayed in the
longdesc form of an irreducible fraction or, where appropriate, an
longdesc integer. This package is intended for educational purposes. The
longdesc videos showing its writing from scratch are available on
longdesc youtube from episode 24: https://youtu.be/6lF4P6B3msw. This is
longdesc why it is delivered with only a minimalist documentation.
